{"server":"cn","storyId":"act26side_level_act26side_06_beg","groupId":"act26side","stageId":"act26side_06","title":"夜半歌声","storyCode":"HE-6","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act26side/level_act26side_06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"eda2022ec20a5e78563b1675265a2a2f5c6602c3d895a26bbb677fa74284df19","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在奥伦的指派下，拉特兰的部队即将攻入修道院，这一消息很快传入准备离开的萨卡兹耳中。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都检查过了，屋内没有打斗的迹象，两个孩子没被吵醒，都还在睡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫曼不可能会伤害孩子们，这点你可以放心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是暂时还没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并不确定她的理智能够保持多长时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......多谢你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等孩子们醒了，你打算怎么告诉他们赫曼的事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们有权知情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有的事不知道或许更好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是否可以理解为，你在向我提出建议？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，费德里科......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，你不介意我这么喊吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放过赫曼的是你，得到孩子们信赖的也是你，所以决定权在你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感觉有点沉重？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有佩戴负重装备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就当这是你的幽默感了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在看什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你认识这个吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......被褥的碎布？不少居民都用这种布做冬天的被褥，不过这种花纹倒是头一次见到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是拉特兰常见的花纹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"破碎的布料下方，双胞胎的鼻息绵长安稳。\n执行者近乎凝视地看了一会，才将视线转向一旁简陋的木桌上。\n那里摆着一只陶土小瓶。\n插在瓶内，尚未完全枯萎的浅色花束，是室内除了孩子们之外唯一的色彩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......花？不太新鲜了，应该是这两天都没有更换。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是赫曼本人的兴趣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......不确定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原以为我对这些跟着我的人足够了解。但我甚至不能确定......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要立刻回一趟圣堂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于萨卡兹相关的问题，已知的情报已经足够做出判断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，你的判断是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首先我需要了解一件事——你是否与奥伦·亚吉奥拉斯有所交流？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位奥伦特使？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有多少交流。他来这没多久就失踪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"了解了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你自称杰拉尔德，但这不是你的真名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一个被使用了十年的名字，谁能说它不是真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们在这里过日子，从用那些破木板在这里搭起第一间屋子开始，我就只是荒野猎户杰拉尔德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的自我认知与我无关。你可以是杰拉尔德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"古怪的急迫感驱使着语言自口腔滑落。\n费德里科没有给对方说话的空间。\n他张口说出了那个已经十年没有再被正式提起过的名字。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡兹戴尔内战中崭露头角的雇佣兵，中庭公证所通缉的在逃人员之一，共有三十二项被记录的罪名，曾灭杀教皇厅旗下三支执行小队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"霍斯特·蒂芬达尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我知道。而我可以查到的信息，其他人也一样可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这会是最后一次警告——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰拉尔德，你的身份已经不是秘密。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的拉特兰特勤队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"确认前方建筑，是目标地点无误。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的拉特兰特勤队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的会有萨卡兹愿意住在我们的修道院里吗？真难想象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的拉特兰特勤队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_371_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要准备行动了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的拉特兰特勤队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不着急。等长官们的指令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的拉特兰特勤队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"继续观察吧。总归我们的人已经把这一带都围上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的拉特兰特勤队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像之前抓到的那个萨卡兹小队一样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的拉特兰特勤队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要是萨卡兹，就一个都别想跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的拉特兰特勤队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_371_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g9_monasteryroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我拿了吃的回来。能找到的东西不多，稍微吃一点？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，斯普莉雅......我没有胃口......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，我先放这，没准一会你就感觉饿了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你，斯普莉雅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又谢我什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也没什么，就是想......谢你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想谢我的话，就把这些东西吃掉，然后快点睡觉吧！这样的话我也可以早点下班，多好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是这样吗？那我现在就睡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，我睡不着......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"猜到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一直留在这里不要紧吗？我现在已经好多了，所以，呃，我的意思是......你不用特地留下陪我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看住你是我的工作，好姑娘，别把我想得那么体贴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你放心，我不会逃走的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可说不定，越是看起来乖的小姑娘，往往越要小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道你头上那对黑色的角意味着什么吗？你知道按你现在的状态，被带回拉特兰之后会面对什么样的处境吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你当然不会知道啦。你现在都没法和我共感了，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别做出那种表情嘛，刚刚是吓唬你的，教宗阁下脾气很好，别太担心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有担心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管会受什么样的惩罚，都是我应得的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么声音？有人在外面......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管外面发生什么，都与你无关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乖乖待在这，我去看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g11_monasterycorridor_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪了，没人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"才这么一段时间不见，你的警觉度就已经低到这个程度了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。你这家伙说话还是这么让人讨厌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真怀疑你当时在维多利亚是怎么干活的，该不会净给拉特兰在外头结仇了吧，奥伦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这可就冤枉我了，明明我才是最兢兢业业的那一个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说到工作，你那边应该已经准备好了吧，斯普莉雅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不太喜欢兜圈子，给我一个肯定的回复。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么意外的话，天亮前就动手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g9_monasteryroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（奇怪......斯普莉雅怎么还没回来？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（外面没有动静了......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（什、什么声音？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯普莉雅......？是你吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呀......唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"压低的男声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘘，别出声。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱蒙德？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我走，福尔图娜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g5_gatheringplace_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"终于出来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么你会在这，蕾缪安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出了一点小状况。被一个讨厌的家伙拦住，还被他给逃走了......唉，这么说出来感觉更丢人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为听到从这附近传来了一点动静，就赶过来看了看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有点没想到呢，费德里科你会说出这样威胁的话来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威胁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊呀？难道不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你刚刚说的那些，是什么意思......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是说出实情。正确的判断建立在知晓真实现状的基础之上，我没有威胁谁的必要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......你的想法我姑且可以理解啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，人可是最难以预测的生物，很多时候连我们自己都会搞不清楚自己的想法，行动和想法完全不是一回事的情况也不少见......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根据我的经验，事情往往不会按照“最合理”的方向发展呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个话题先放一边......看来目前的情况比我想象的要复杂不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来吧，费德里科，我们需要交换情报。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g5_gatheringplace_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的意思是，我们看到的那个怪物，就是那名叫作赫曼的失踪的萨卡兹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看到她时她的状态，和我面对她的时候听起来还有所不同。如果是这样的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"失去正常的生理形态，从无法交流、丧失理智，表现出明显的进食欲望的状态，转变为残留少量理智，能够开口沟通的状态。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"进化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以暂时这样推测。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的身上发生了某种转化，我曾在执行一项有关伊比利亚的任务中查阅过相关资料，有一个教会组织在海岸线附近频繁活动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"深海教会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很了解呢，费德里科。你在之前的任务里也见过类似的生物吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那也是见过，这样说起来就方便多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前有点在意那边的事情，所以稍微了解过一些......关于那个教会，我们之后或许会和伊比利亚那边的审判庭合作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教宗阁下最近也在头痛这件事，没想到竟然会在这里碰上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的哦，很棘手，也很危险......刚刚拦住我的那一个，如果不是对方主动退开的话，我应该赢不了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让人有点火大......看来还是得更快一点恢复到过去的水平才行。不然的话，别说那个笑眯眯的教士了，就连斯普莉雅也敢小瞧我了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说到这个，费德里科，你把这些都告诉那位杰拉尔德先生真的好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他有知情的权利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，你决定就好。现在你准备怎么做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"查一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火不会自己点燃。圣堂的失火有古怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有花......不，还不能确定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首先，我需要找到那些助燃物。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，这个点突然把你们喊起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还好，有不少人本来就睡不着，一喊就起来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人我都通知到了，杰拉尔德，我们随时能出发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过......你之前不是还说要等到早上再走？怎么忽然改变主意了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是因为那场火......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰拉尔德，我可以保证，这事绝对不是莱蒙德那小子干的，所以我们没必要这么急匆匆地——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我不怀疑他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有突发情况。这个之后再解释，总之，我们等不到早上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前出去的队伍还没有消息？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有，很不对劲，我怕他们是遇上了什么麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么办，杰拉尔德，需要我再带几个人一起出去探路吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不用，我们一起走，到时候提醒其他人跟紧队伍，任何人都不要落单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在前面探路，让那几个老家伙跟着我一起。你带着莱蒙德守住后方，没问题吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有问题。你的态度不对劲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到底出了什么事？杰拉尔德，你在紧张，因为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是因为那些拉特兰人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......瞒不过你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还是那么谨慎，里德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打住。我现在不叫那个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我只是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"杰拉尔德没能把话说下去。\n他意识到为什么这位老伙计能一眼看出自己的状态不对，他意识到，他正下意识将一只手按在藏在腰间的匕首上。\n他正逐渐从猎户杰拉尔德变回那个雇佣兵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我的错。刚刚的气氛......太像之前我们还在卡兹戴尔那时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不确定这是不是我多心，但我现在的感觉很不好。老伙计，你可以把这当作是我的直觉，我们该尽快离开。越快越好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，越快越好。你带着准备好的人先走，立刻就出发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是那句话。你是头儿，都听你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过提醒一句，上一次你的直觉是我们能找到一个好地方，抛下过去好好过日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们会找到的，我发誓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我信你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上一次你也确实带着我们找到这儿了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但愿能顺利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，爱琳，这次没法带你一起走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你会怪我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你还在，看到现在的光景，你又会怎么想......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是谁？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是我，杰拉尔德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你在忙吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有件事情，我想或许应该告诉你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g1_monasteryentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，老人家还真是有压迫感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是的......只是来出个任务，我也不想搞成这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又是萨卡兹，又是堕天，现在还要加上一个发疯的主教。真是饶了我吧，这地方的水未免也太深了一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"偏偏被一起派来的还是费德里科......嗯，该说是好还是坏呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以防万一......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奥伦，是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是快要动手了？现在你那里应该有人手吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我建议你最好查一查这个叫斯特凡诺的主教，我觉得他不太对劲，搞不好还有点危险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直觉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能算是吧......这座修道院给我的感觉不怎么好，唉，也不能这么说，就是因为还算不错，所以才不太好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在这的时间比我久，难道没有这种感觉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说，怎么会有这种所有人都挺努力，但却偏偏没什么希望的地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这也太让人难受了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事情就是这样......我没想到莱蒙德还不知道这个消息，就把德尔菲娜和福尔图娜的事情告诉他了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他看起来很激动，说实话，我有点担心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......还好吗？杰拉尔德？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我没事。别担心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是你的问题，是我没来得及找机会告诉他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱蒙德人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他问了我福尔图娜的事，然后就冲出去了。我听到他说要去把福尔图娜带回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"福尔图娜那里应该有拉特兰的使者守着，真的不要紧吗......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......萨科塔不可能允许他这么干。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱蒙德他出生在这里，这里和外面不同。他对我们和萨科塔之间的关系还是不够了解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得你说过，萨科塔和萨卡兹的关系......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很糟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我们真的只是平民，或许还不会糟到这个地步......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那莱蒙德现在岂不是很危险？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我现在去找他。多谢你告诉我这些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能做的事情很少......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰拉尔德，现在我开始觉得你的决定是正确的，你们该早点离开这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，立刻就离开，这是明智的选择，不要......不要等明天......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我确实有这个打算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克莱芒，你的脸色不太好......是不是还发生了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很好。我只是有点......今天发生了太多事，我有点，不好受......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，杰拉尔德，你说得对，我们不是一路，别再留在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你现在的状态很不好，克莱芒，冷静一点。你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好了，头儿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们按照你说的，准备从之前探路队出发的反方向出发，但我在前面发现了一支部队正在朝修道院的方向靠近！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说......部队？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是拉特兰人！有萨科塔，还有穿着戍卫队制服的家伙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们当年和那群混账干过多少仗，我再熟不过，错不了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们很快就会被包围......哈哈，杰拉尔德，你听到了吗？我们很快就会被包围！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们从一开始就没打算放过我们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"杰拉尔德猛地缩了缩手指。\n几息之后，他才察觉是自己的指尖太过冰冷了，衬得套着匕首的皮革反而都像是在发热一样。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克莱芒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在。杰拉尔德，现在该怎么办......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别担心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我逃了太久，现在只不过是让一切重新回到正轨......事情很快就会解决。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"头儿，要怎么干，你说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大伙心里都有这个准备，随时能动手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么些年，也辛苦你们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要做什么？杰拉尔德，你要做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你别冲动，先把匕首放下......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很冷静，克莱芒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"萨卡兹深深地吐气，更加用力握住匕首，雪亮的刀刃缓缓自鞘中被拔出。\n实在是太烫了。\n有一瞬间，杰拉尔德几乎快要抓不稳自己的老伙计。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这十年来，我从未如今天一般清醒过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果只有鲜血能让这一切结束，那么我所能做的事就只剩下这么一件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别为此担忧，萨卡兹的血不会白白流淌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
